Typ
===

A typeface.

Requirements
------------

To build the BDF file, nothing except a POSIX system is needed.

To build the TTF file, the
[bdf2ttf Python package](https://pypi.org/project/bdf2ttf/) is required.

Building
--------

To only build the BDF file, run the following:

	$ make bdf

Otherwise, just run:

	$ make

Structure
---------

The <chars> directory contains the mapping file, which matches each raw
character file to a list of actual characters. Each raw character file is just a
grid of dots and hashes; the hashes draw the glyph of the character.
